  "question": {
    "text": "A linear object is placed along the axis of a mirror as shown in the figure. If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></math> is the focal length of the mirror, then the length of the image is<br />\r<br />\r<br />\r<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/ci/image11-75d04bee-4637-42df-b1f8-eb3dd4f89052.png\" />",
